  "title": "Carmen J NDE 6176",
  "date": "6 14 2008",
  "content": "I was in an infrared frequency, where everything was sepia tone. I was put in a bath to clean off, and then passed out as I got out of the bath. What I saw was all in sepia orange tone: my body being lifted up by my significant other. I looked like a rag doll. I was naked and a river of reddish brown was flowing out of my mouth down my chest and down my thighs. All fluids were being released from my body. I thought it was fascinating. I observed from the ceiling. I was pulled further and further away. I just kept looking at the frantic person holding the rag doll that kept slipping through his hands as it spewed the rivers of brown on the body. I was definitely separate from that body that was more like a garment, a space suit. I was whirling up, up, up. Then, from far away, I heard this desperate yelling noise. I didn't recognize the sound. As I focused on the sound, I was being drawn to the sound until I got close enough to it, to distinguish it. It was my SO who was frantically calling my name, 'Carmen! Carmen! Carmen!' At that moment, I was back in my body, and then just passed in and out of consciousness until the paramedics arrived. I was taken to the hospital. I don't remember the ride, but I was fine in the morning. The experience was not speeded up like when I was in a car accident. It was much different.",
